counterfactuals.output:
1. A vehicle gearshift assembly comprising:

a support structure;

a shift lever mounted to the support structure for movement about a first axis and a second axis;

a carrier supported by the support structure and constrained to move along a predetermined guide path;

a link coupling the shift lever to the carrier such that movement of the shift lever about at least one of the first axis and the second axis produces movement of the carrier along the guide path;

a first sensor array arranged to detect a position of the carrier; and

a second sensor array arranged to detect a position of the shift lever,

wherein outputs of the first sensor array and the second sensor array collectively indicate a selected gearshift state.
